  "name": "NCS-6 Total Scoring",
  "status": "validated",
  "description": "Need for Cognition (NCS-6). Total = sum of the 6 items (each 1-5), range 6-30. Higher scores indicate greater need for cognition (reverse-keyed items are reversed by the runtime). No standard severity cut-offs.",
